[[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the trim fixing bolt.</p><p>2. Move the trim (2a) releasing the retainers (2b).</p><p>3. Disconnect the electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s front tweeter speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428758\">P45</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>3</p></td><td><p>Front passenger side tweeter speaker</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/2428760\">P46</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>4. Keep the trim</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2045137.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[15,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim and the\ntweeter are not damaged.</p><p>Connect the electrical connection.</p><p>Position the trim fitting the retainers.</p><p>Tighten the retaining bolt.</p><p>Check that the interior handle and the\nspeaker are working.</p>"]]